    "semanticRules": [
      "`PK(on_deck_package_id,ordinal)`及`UNIQUE(on_deck_package_id,material_key)`",
      "Workspace Handle JSON≤`16 KiB`",
      "一个Physical Material在同一Product Manifest只有一个业务role，ordinal从0连续且至少一个primary，只有primary允许Episode relation",
      "primary assert固定命中Run Input且Control pair非NULL",
      "related assert固定命中同Run frozen Related Binding/Reference，source ref与derived authority非NULL而Control pair全NULL",
