      "direct input使用bounded fingerprint，Workspace output使用写入流Artifact digest",
      "member/set digest按8.6.21唯一公式"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`on_deck_package_id FK, ordinal, material_handle_id NULL, material_key, role(primary_payload|structural_dependency|metadata_sidecar|poster|fanart|subtitle|external_audio|chapter|sidecar), source_related_reference_id NULL, derived_authority_digest NULL, mount_scope_id, inode, fingerprint_algorithm, fingerprint_version, content_fingerprint, location_kind(domain_binding|workspace_handle), endpoint_id, location NULL, root_handle_ref NULL, relative_path NULL, binding_kind(libra_material_binding|workspace_material_reference), binding_revision, binding_evidence_digest, origin_intake_decision_id NULL FK, origin_offer_id NULL, origin_candidate_package_id NULL, origin_package_revision NULL, origin_package_digest NULL, origin_candidate_delivery_snapshot_digest NULL, origin_related_reference_set_digest NULL, workspace_reference_id NULL, workspace_handle_schema_ref NULL, workspace_handle_json NULL, workspace_handle_digest NULL, output_requirement_digest, episode_claim_set_digest, digest_algorithm, digest_hex, size_bytes, control_operation(assert_existing_input|assert_related_input|acquire_workspace_product), expected_control_revision NULL, expected_control_projection_digest NULL, committed_control_revision NULL, committed_control_projection_digest NULL, member_digest`",
      "constraints": "`PK(on_deck_package_id,ordinal)`及`UNIQUE(on_deck_package_id,material_key)`；Workspace Handle JSON≤`16 KiB`；一个Physical Material在同一Product Manifest只有一个业务role，ordinal从0连续且至少一个primary，只有primary允许Episode relation；primary assert固定命中Run Input且Control pair非NULL；related assert固定命中同Run frozen Related Binding/Reference，source ref与derived authority非NULL而Control pair全NULL；Workspace acquire固定命中current Product Staging Reference并取得Libra Product Control。三种variant严格互斥；direct input使用bounded fingerprint，Workspace output使用写入流Artifact digest；member/set digest按8.6.21唯一公式"
